@startuml state
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 110
skinparam ranksep 110
title Recipe Builder - System-Level State Diagram

[*] --> SignedOut

state SignedOut : favorites, notes, ratings\nand account changes refused (401)
state SignedIn : pantry and restrictions\nsaved to the account
state AccountDeleted

SignedOut --> SignedIn : sign in / sign up\n[valid credentials]
SignedOut --> SignedOut : sign in\n[wrong credentials] / show error
SignedIn --> SignedOut : sign out
SignedIn --> AccountDeleted : delete account\n[correct password]
AccountDeleted --> [*]

state "Recipe search" as Search {
  [*] --> EmptyPantry
  EmptyPantry --> PantryReady : add ingredient
  PantryReady --> EmptyPantry : remove last ingredient /\nclear pantry
  PantryReady --> PantryReady : add / remove ingredient,\nchange filters
  PantryReady --> Searching : Generate Recipes
  Searching --> ShowingResults : results found
  Searching --> NoResults : nothing matched
  Searching --> SearchFailed : Spoonacular error /\nquota reached
  ShowingResults --> ResultsStale : ingredients or filters changed
  ResultsStale --> Searching : Find recipes
  ShowingResults --> Searching : change sort order
  NoResults --> PantryReady : edit ingredients or filters
  SearchFailed --> Searching : try again
  ShowingResults --> ViewingRecipe : open a recipe
  ViewingRecipe --> ShowingResults : back
}

note right of Search
  Runs alongside the sign-in states:
  a guest and a signed-in cook
  search the same way.
end note

legend right
  |= Symbol |= Meaning |
  | filled circle | where it starts |
  | circle with a ring | where it ends |
  | box | a state: a situation the app is in |
  | big box holding states | a group of states that belong together |
  | arrow | a change of state, labelled with the event that causes it |
  | [ ... ] on an arrow | a condition that must be true for the change |
endlegend
@enduml
